        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Javad Hadian\n- Companies: InBev, Anheuser-Busch, Anheuser-Busch InBev (AB InBev)\n- Events: lawsuit, acquisition\n- Topics: 1998 agreement\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Javad Hadian sued InBev for allegedly violating the 1998 agreement.\n- InBev was the world's largest beer producer at the time of the 2004 lawsuit.\n- InBev existed independently until its 2008 acquisition of Anheuser-Busch.\n- The 2008 acquisition of Anheuser-Busch formed Anheuser-Busch InBev, abbreviated AB InBev.",
